              <td>~6 Pickup Truck Loads</td>
              <td>2 Tons (4,000 lbs)</td>
              <td>Small bathroom/kitchen remodels, garage cleanouts, heavy sod/tile</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>20 Yard Dumpster</strong></td>
              <td>18' L × 7' W × 4.5' H</td>
              <td>~8 Pickup Truck Loads</td>
              <td>3 Tons (6,000 lbs)</td>
              <td>Roofing tear-offs, multi-room renovations, flooring removal</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>30 Yard Dumpster</strong></td>
              <td>19' L × 7' W × 7' H</td>
              <td>~12 Pickup Truck Loads</td>
              <td>4 Tons (8,000 lbs)</td>
